/* ================= Game text in Portuguese (Lexicon Saga and Wordling Trails) =================
   Brazilian Portuguese, written so it also reads well in Portugal: the player is spoken to without "você" (Escolha…,
   Tem…, Encontrou…), and me / te / se go after the verb unless a word like "não" pulls them in front. gametr-pt-pt.js turns
   this book into the European Portuguese one (Guardar for Salvar, ecrã for tela, "a fazer" for "fazendo"…).
   Made from the same English lines as gametr-es.js, gametr-more.js, gametr-saga8.js and saga-part13.js. */
